msgid "HG-DAgger: Collect Corrections"
msgstr "HG-DAgger: Correction 수집"

msgid "Physical SO-101 holding a vial above the yellow rack."
msgstr "실제 SO-101이 yellow rack 위에서 vial을 잡고 있습니다."

msgid "What Do I Need for This Module?"
msgstr "이 Module에 필요한 준비물"

msgid ""
"Hands-on. You’ll need the current Newton workshop container, a calibrated leader arm, a policy "
"checkpoint, and an NVIDIA GPU. For real collection, you also need the calibrated follower and "
"both cameras."
msgstr ""
"실습입니다. 현재 Newton workshop container, calibration된 leader arm, policy checkpoint, NVIDIA GPU가 "
"필요합니다. 실제 수집에는 calibration된 follower와 camera 두 대도 필요합니다."

msgid ""
"In this session, you’ll pause the policy, guide it through a correction with the leader arm, and "
"save that correction for training."
msgstr "Policy를 pause하고 leader로 correction을 수행한 뒤 학습용으로 저장합니다."

msgid ""
"The leader arm will move In this lesson, the **physical leader (teleop) arm moves under motor "
"power** during startup, alignment, resets, and normal exit—even when the follower is simulated. "
"Keep its path clear. Support the leader before pressing **G** or **L** to release its torque."
msgstr ""
"Leader arm이 움직입니다. **실제 leader(teleop) arm은 시작, 정렬, reset, 정상 종료 중 motor 전원으로 움직입니다.** Follower가 "
"simulation이어도 같습니다. 이동 경로를 비우고 **G** 또는 **L**로 torque를 풀기 전에 leader를 받쳐 주세요."

msgid "Learning Objectives"
msgstr "학습 목표"

msgid "**Align** the leader, collect a correction, and return control to the policy."
msgstr "Leader를 **정렬**하고 correction을 수집한 뒤 policy에 제어권 반환"

msgid "**Compare** assisted collection with autonomous evaluation."
msgstr "사람이 돕는 수집과 자율 평가 **비교**"

msgid "Prepare the Workshop Container"
msgstr "Workshop Container 준비"

msgid "Use the instructor-prepared container or the image built in [Get the Code](06-get-the-code.md)."
msgstr "Instructor가 준비한 container 또는 [Get the Code](06-get-the-code.md)에서 build한 image를 사용합니다."

msgid "**Stop** any teleoperation or evaluation session using the arms or cameras."
msgstr "Arm이나 camera를 사용하는 teleoperation 및 evaluation session을 **종료**합니다."

msgid "**Continue** in your workshop container terminal; saved settings load when the shell starts."
msgstr "Workshop container terminal에서 **계속**합니다. 저장된 설정은 shell 시작 시 로드됩니다."

msgid ""
"Check the saved `TELEOP_PORT` and `TELEOP_ID` for the leader, and `ROBOT_PORT` and `ROBOT_ID` for"
" the real follower. For real collection, verify `CAMERA_GRIPPER` and `CAMERA_EXTERNAL` as in "
"[Camera Setup](08-operating-so101.md#camera-setup), then build the camera configuration in this "
"shell:"
msgstr ""
"Leader의 `TELEOP_PORT`, `TELEOP_ID`와 실제 follower의 `ROBOT_PORT`, `ROBOT_ID`를 확인합니다. 실제 수집에서는 "
"[Camera Setup](08-operating-so101.md#camera-setup)에 따라 `CAMERA_GRIPPER`, `CAMERA_EXTERNAL`을 확인하고 "
"이 shell에서 camera configuration을 만듭니다."

msgid ""
"Repeat this export after opening a new shell. It uses the `wrist` and `external` camera keys "
"expected by the policy below."
msgstr "새 shell을 열면 export를 반복하세요. 아래 policy가 기대하는 `wrist`, `external` key를 사용합니다."

msgid "**Select** the co-trained checkpoint you want to improve:"
msgstr "개선하려는 Co-Trained checkpoint를 **선택**합니다."

msgid "What to Expect"
msgstr "예상되는 동작"

msgid ""
"This model was trained on 75 simulated teleoperation demonstrations and 10 real demonstrations. "
"In our real-robot trials, it succeeded in **10 of 20 episodes (50%)**. Watch for a placement that"
" misses the rack slot; those failures are opportunities to pause and collect a correction."
msgstr ""
"Simulation teleoperation 75개와 실제 demonstration 10개로 학습한 model이며 실제 시험에서 **20 episode 중 10개(50%)**"
" 성공했습니다. Rack slot을 놓치는 placement를 관찰하고, pause한 뒤 correction을 수집하세요."

msgid ""
"Keep `your_hf_username` for local-only collection, or replace it with your Hugging Face username "
"if you plan to upload. The correction dataset stays local until you upload it."
msgstr ""
"Local 수집만 하면 `your_hf_username`을 유지하고 upload할 계획이면 본인의 username으로 바꿉니다. Correction dataset은 "
"upload 전까지 local에만 저장됩니다."

msgid "Teach the Rest Poses"
msgstr "Rest Pose 지정"

msgid "**Support** the leader in its resting position on the bench."
msgstr "Leader를 bench 위의 rest pose에서 **받쳐 줍니다**."

msgid "**Run** this once per leader calibration:"
msgstr "Leader calibration마다 한 번 **실행**합니다."

msgid ""
"For real collection, **leave** the follower sitting folded, for example right after power-on, and"
" **run** this once per follower calibration:"
msgstr "실제 수집에서는 follower를 전원 직후처럼 접어 놓은 상태로 **두고**, follower calibration마다 한 번 **실행**합니다."

msgid ""
"Both commands save the current position without moving the arm or releasing its torque. Normal "
"exit will return each arm here. Until the follower's rest is taught, exit returns the follower to"
" its pose at startup."
msgstr ""
"두 명령은 arm을 움직이거나 torque를 풀지 않고 현재 위치만 저장합니다. 정상 종료 시 해당 위치로 돌아옵니다. Follower rest를 지정하기 전에는 시작할 때의"
" pose로 돌아갑니다."

msgid ""
"The leader moves under power during startup, alignment, resets, and normal exit. Keep its path "
"clear. Support it before pressing **G** or **L**, which release its torque; there is no gravity "
"compensation. Follow the [robot safety guidance](08-operating-so101.md#safety)."
msgstr ""
"Leader는 시작, 정렬, reset, 정상 종료 중 전원으로 움직입니다. 경로를 비우세요. Torque를 푸는 **G**, **L** 전에 leader를 받쳐 줍니다. "
"Gravity compensation은 없습니다. [Robot safety 안내](08-operating-so101.md#safety)를 따르세요."

msgid "Start Collection"
msgstr "수집 시작"

msgid ""
"For the **real follower**, run `lerobot-rollout-dagger`. It runs the collection session inside "
"LeRobot's `lerobot-rollout`, which loads the policy in this process, so no policy server is "
"needed:"
msgstr ""
"**실제 follower**에는 `lerobot-rollout-dagger`를 실행합니다. LeRobot의 `lerobot-rollout` 안에서 policy를 직접 "
"로드하므로 별도 policy server가 필요하지 않습니다."

msgid ""
"For this exercise, the starting pose comes from the 75 sim-teleoperation demonstrations used in "
"co-training, rather than averaging the entire merged dataset. Startup moves both arms to the mean"
" episode-start pose from that sim dataset. Check the printed starting-pose values before "
"beginning policy execution. Each arm opens its gripper first, then moves its shoulder, elbow, and"
" wrist before turning its base and wrist roll. Remove any held vial before starting or resetting;"
" opening the gripper will drop it."
msgstr ""
"이 실습의 starting pose는 merged dataset 전체가 아니라 Co-Training의 sim-teleoperation 75개에서 계산합니다. 시작하면 두 "
"arm이 해당 dataset의 평균 시작 pose로 움직입니다. Policy 실행 전에 출력된 값을 확인하세요. 각 arm은 먼저 gripper를 열고 "
"shoulder·elbow·wrist를 움직인 뒤 base와 wrist roll을 돌립니다. Gripper가 열리면 vial이 떨어지므로 시작/reset 전에 잡고 있는 "
"vial을 제거하세요."

msgid "Try collection in simulation instead"
msgstr "대신 Simulation에서 수집하기"

msgid ""
"The current `lerobot_dagger` simulation command does not support `--start_pose_dataset`; it uses "
"the task's default starting pose. This is not a matched-start comparison with the real collection"
" command above."
msgstr ""
"현재 simulation 명령 `lerobot_dagger`는 `--start_pose_dataset`을 지원하지 않고 task 기본 pose를 사용합니다. 따라서 위 실제 "
"명령과 시작 조건이 일치하는 비교가 아닙니다."

msgid ""
"Simulation uses `lerobot_dagger` with a policy server. Run these **instead of** the real-follower"
" command. The leader is still a physical arm, but it controls the simulated follower."
msgstr ""
"Simulation은 `lerobot_dagger`와 policy server를 사용합니다. 실제 follower 명령 **대신** 아래를 실행하세요. Leader는 여전히 "
"실물이며 simulation follower를 제어합니다."

msgid "**Start** a dedicated policy server in the background of this terminal:"
msgstr "이 terminal의 background에서 전용 policy server를 **시작**합니다."

msgid ""
"Wait for `Policy server ready`. If it times out, check `tail -n 40 outputs/dagger-policy-"
"server.log` before continuing. Keep this server dedicated to DAgger: another client connection "
"resets its state."
msgstr ""
"`Policy server ready`를 기다립니다. Timeout이면 진행 전에 `tail -n 40 outputs/dagger-policy-server.log`를 "
"확인하세요. 다른 client가 연결되면 state가 reset되므로 이 server는 DAgger 전용으로 유지합니다."

msgid "**Start** collection:"
msgstr "수집을 **시작**합니다."

msgid "When finished, **stop** the policy server from the same shell:"
msgstr "완료하면 같은 shell에서 policy server를 **종료**합니다."

msgid ""
"Keep sim and real corrections in separate datasets, and use different seeds for collection and "
"evaluation."
msgstr "Simulation과 실제 correction은 별도 dataset에 저장하고 수집과 평가의 seed를 다르게 사용하세요."

msgid ""
"Open [http://localhost:8090](http://localhost:8090). The session starts **paused** after "
"alignment to the start pose. Keep the page focused for the keyboard controls. Use only one "
"browser tab connected to the viewer at a time."
msgstr ""
"[http://localhost:8090](http://localhost:8090)을 엽니다. 시작 pose 정렬 후 **paused** 상태로 시작합니다. Keyboard "
"control을 위해 page에 focus를 두고 viewer에는 tab 하나만 연결하세요."

msgid "Align, Correct, and Hand Back"
msgstr "정렬, Correction, 제어권 반환"

msgid "**Press Space** to let the policy run. Watch for the failure you want to correct."
msgstr "**Space**로 policy를 실행하고 수정할 실패를 관찰합니다."

msgid ""
"**Press Space again** to pause. The follower holds its last command; pausing does not move the "
"leader."
msgstr "**Space를 다시 눌러** pause합니다. Follower는 마지막 명령을 유지하며 pause만으로 leader가 움직이지는 않습니다."

msgid ""
"**Press Tab** while paused. Let the leader move to match the follower, and **wait for "
"`correction_ready`**. Do not force the powered arm into position."
msgstr ""
"Paused 상태에서 **Tab**을 누릅니다. Leader가 follower에 맞춰 움직이도록 두고 **`correction_ready`를 기다리세요**. 전원이 켜진 "
"arm을 억지로 움직이지 마세요."

msgid "**Support the leader, then press G**. Its torque releases and your correction begins recording."
msgstr "**Leader를 받친 뒤 G**를 누릅니다. Torque가 풀리고 correction recording이 시작됩니다."

msgid ""
"**Guide the leader** through a useful correction—for example, finish the grasp and lift the vial "
"clear of the mat."
msgstr "**Leader를 움직여** 유용한 correction을 수행합니다. 예를 들어 grasp를 마치고 vial을 mat에서 들어 올립니다."

msgid ""
"**Press Space** to hold the leader, save the correction, and return control to the policy. Look "
"for `Episode N saved` to confirm the write."
msgstr "**Space**로 leader를 고정하고 correction을 저장한 뒤 policy에 제어권을 돌려줍니다. `Episode N saved`로 저장을 확인하세요."

msgid "Repeat as needed within the same rollout:"
msgstr "같은 rollout에서 필요에 따라 반복합니다."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "**Space → Space → Tab → wait → G → correct → Space**"
msgstr "**Space → Space → Tab → wait → G → correct → Space**"

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "Key"
msgstr "Key"

msgid "What it does"
msgstr "기능"

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "**Space**"
msgstr "**Space**"

msgid "Start or pause the policy; while correcting, save and resume the policy."
msgstr "Policy 시작/일시 정지. Correction 중에는 저장하고 policy 재개."

msgid "**Tab**, while paused"
msgstr "Paused 상태에서 **Tab**"

msgid "Move the leader to match the follower; wait for `correction_ready`."
msgstr "Leader를 follower에 맞춰 이동. `correction_ready` 대기."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "**G**"
msgstr "**G**"

msgid "Release leader torque and begin or continue a correction."
msgstr "Leader torque 해제 후 correction 시작 또는 계속."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "**X**"
msgstr "**X**"

msgid "Freeze and hold, keeping the unfinished correction. **G** continues it; **Space** saves it."
msgstr "미완료 correction을 유지하며 정지·고정. **G**로 계속, **Space**로 저장."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "**C**"
msgstr "**C**"

msgid "Discard the unfinished correction and pause."
msgstr "미완료 correction 폐기 후 일시 정지."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "**R**"
msgstr "**R**"

msgid "Discard the unfinished correction and reset the arms to the start pose."
msgstr "미완료 correction을 폐기하고 arm을 시작 pose로 reset."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "**Esc / Ctrl+C (terminal)**"
msgstr "**Esc / Ctrl+C (terminal)**"

msgid "Exit and return the leader to its taught rest, with torque on."
msgstr "종료 후 torque를 유지한 채 leader를 지정한 rest pose로 복귀."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "**L**"
msgstr "**L**"

msgid "Release leader torque and exit without moving it. Support the leader first."
msgstr "Leader torque를 풀고 이동 없이 종료. 먼저 leader를 받쳐 주세요."

msgid ""
"On the **real robot**, use **R** to end a rollout, then reset the objects by hand while paused. "
"Record the outcome yourself: there is no automatic success, timeout, or safety reset. In "
"**simulation**, success, timeout, or an unsafe scene also resets the environment and pauses for "
"the next rollout."
msgstr ""
"**실제 robot**은 **R**로 rollout을 끝내고 paused 상태에서 물체를 손으로 reset합니다. 자동 성공·timeout·safety reset이 없으므로 "
"결과를 직접 기록하세요. **Simulation**에서는 성공, timeout, unsafe scene도 environment reset과 pause를 유발합니다."

msgid "Keep the leader near the follower during policy control"
msgstr "Policy 제어 중 Leader를 Follower 가까이에 유지"

msgid ""
"Add `--strategy.leader_follows=true` to the real collection command, or `--leader_follows` in "
"simulation. The powered leader tracks the follower during policy motion, which can help when you "
"need frequent corrections. Still pause, press **Tab**, and wait for `correction_ready` before "
"**G**. Tracking is speed-limited, so the leader may lag behind."
msgstr ""
"실제 명령에 `--strategy.leader_follows=true`, simulation에는 `--leader_follows`를 추가합니다. 전원이 켜진 leader가 "
"follower를 따라가 잦은 correction에 도움이 됩니다. 그래도 **G** 전에 pause하고 **Tab**을 누른 뒤 `correction_ready`를 기다려야"
" 합니다. 추적 속도가 제한되어 leader가 늦을 수 있습니다."

msgid "Review and Finish"
msgstr "검토와 종료"

msgid ""
"Save a useful correction with **Space**, or discard it with **C**, before exiting. Normal exit "
"returns the leader to its taught rest. On real hardware, both arms move together through the "
"start pose, each to its own taught rest; both keep torque on. Support them before switching off "
"power."
msgstr ""
"종료 전에 **Space**로 유용한 correction을 저장하거나 **C**로 폐기하세요. 정상 종료 시 leader가 지정된 rest로 복귀합니다. 실제 "
"hardware에서는 두 arm이 함께 시작 pose를 거쳐 각자의 rest로 이동하며 torque를 유지합니다. 전원을 끄기 전에 받쳐 주세요."

msgid "At the container prompt, **inspect** a saved correction:"
msgstr "Container prompt에서 저장한 correction을 **확인**합니다."

msgid ""
"Add `--resume=true` to the real collection command, or `--resume` in simulation, to append more "
"corrections to the same dataset. To start another round separately, change `CORRECTION_ID`."
msgstr ""
"같은 dataset에 추가하려면 실제 명령에 `--resume=true`, simulation에 `--resume`을 추가합니다. 새 round는 "
"`CORRECTION_ID`를 바꾸세요."

msgid "What Gets Recorded?"
msgstr "무엇이 기록될까?"

msgid "Part of the session"
msgstr "Session 구간"

msgid "Recorded?"
msgstr "기록 여부"

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "Policy rollout"
msgstr "Policy rollout"

msgid "No"
msgstr "아니요"

msgid "Pause, alignment, or reset"
msgstr "Pause, alignment, reset"

msgid "Human correction with the leader"
msgstr "Leader로 수행한 human correction"

msgid "Yes, when you save it"
msgstr "저장하면 기록됨"

msgid ""
"Each saved correction becomes one LeRobot episode. A short grasp, lift, or placement is enough; "
"you do not need to repeat the whole task. Review the episodes before training, and keep "
"simulation and real corrections in separate datasets."
msgstr ""
"저장한 correction 하나가 LeRobot episode 하나가 됩니다. 짧은 grasp, lift, placement도 충분하며 전체 task를 반복할 필요는 "
"없습니다. 학습 전에 검토하고 simulation과 실제 correction은 별도 dataset으로 유지하세요."

msgid "Evaluate the Updated Policy"
msgstr "갱신된 Policy 평가"

msgid ""
"Use this provided checkpoint to try a policy trained with corrections. It was trained from GR00T "
"1.7 base weights on 75 sim demonstrations, 10 real demonstrations, and 29 correction segments. "
"Your newly collected corrections are not included in this checkpoint."
msgstr ""
"제공된 checkpoint로 correction 학습 효과를 시험합니다. GR00T 1.7 base에서 simulation demonstration 75개, 실제 10개, "
"correction segment 29개로 학습했습니다. 방금 직접 수집한 correction은 이 checkpoint에 포함되지 않습니다."

msgid "**Exit** the correction session and wait for both arms to finish returning to rest."
msgstr "Correction session을 **종료**하고 두 arm이 rest로 돌아올 때까지 기다립니다."

msgid "**Select** the corrected model. Keep your verified camera configuration:"
msgstr "Correction을 학습한 model을 **선택**하고 검증한 camera 설정을 유지합니다."

msgid ""
"This model was trained on 75 simulated teleoperation demonstrations, 10 real demonstrations, and "
"29 human correction segments. In our real-robot trials, it succeeded in **14 of 20 episodes "
"(70%)**. Look for changes in slot alignment and placement, and check that grasping and lifting "
"still work."
msgstr ""
"Simulation teleoperation 75개, 실제 demonstration 10개, human correction segment 29개로 학습했습니다. 실제 시험은 "
"**20 episode 중 14개(70%)** 성공했습니다. Slot 정렬과 placement의 변화를 보고 grasp와 lift도 여전히 잘 되는지 확인하세요."

msgid ""
"Use the sim-teleoperation demonstrations for the starting pose, as in the collection command "
"above. Correction segments begin partway through the task, so their initial frames are not full-"
"task starting poses. Before starting policy actions, verify the achieved pose against the sim "
"demonstrations."
msgstr ""
"위 수집 명령처럼 starting pose는 sim-teleoperation demonstration을 사용합니다. Correction은 task 중간부터 시작하므로 초기 "
"frame을 전체 task 시작 pose로 쓸 수 없습니다. Policy action 전에 실제 pose를 simulation demonstration과 비교하세요."

msgid "Optional: Try This Policy in Simulation First"
msgstr "선택 사항: 먼저 Simulation에서 시험"

msgid ""
"**Stop** the real rollout and continue in the same container terminal. Keep the selected "
"`MODEL_ID` and task instruction."
msgstr "실제 rollout을 **종료**한 뒤 같은 container terminal을 사용합니다. `MODEL_ID`와 task instruction은 유지합니다."

msgid "**Start** the simulation policy server below, or reuse it if it is already running."
msgstr "아래 simulation policy server를 **시작**하거나 이미 실행 중이면 재사용합니다."

msgid "**Wait** for `Policy server ready`, then **run** the evaluation:"
msgstr "`Policy server ready`를 **기다린 뒤** 평가를 **실행**합니다."

msgid ""
"**Open** [http://localhost:8090](http://localhost:8090). Use only one browser tab connected to "
"the viewer at a time."
msgstr "[http://localhost:8090](http://localhost:8090)을 **엽니다**. Viewer에는 browser tab 하나만 연결하세요."

msgid ""
"**Stop** the background server before running the real policy. If evaluation is still running, "
"press **Ctrl+C** first:"
msgstr "실제 policy를 실행하기 전에 background server를 **종료**합니다. 평가가 실행 중이면 먼저 **Ctrl+C**를 누르세요."

msgid "Or **stop all policy servers** in the container:"
msgstr "또는 container의 **모든 policy server를 종료**합니다."

msgid ""
"If reusing a server from another terminal, stop it there instead. Continue with the real rollout "
"below; it loads the policy directly."
msgstr "다른 terminal의 server를 재사용했다면 해당 terminal에서 종료합니다. 아래 실제 rollout은 policy를 직접 로드합니다."

msgid "**Run** the corrected policy on the real robot without intervening:"
msgstr "개입 없이 실제 robot에서 correction 학습 policy를 **실행**합니다."

msgid "Rollout controls"
msgstr "Rollout Control"

msgid ""
"The arm moves to the workshop start pose on startup, then waits for **P**. Keep the rollout "
"terminal focused. Keys are case-insensitive."
msgstr ""
"시작 시 arm이 workshop 시작 pose로 움직인 뒤 **P**를 기다립니다. Rollout terminal에 focus를 두세요. Key는 대소문자를 구분하지 "
"않습니다."

msgid ""
"Wait for `Paused` before rearranging props. On exit, wait for cleanup and any return motion to "
"finish before touching the arm."
msgstr "소품을 옮기기 전에 `Paused`를 기다리세요. 종료할 때도 cleanup과 복귀 동작이 끝난 뒤 arm을 만집니다."

msgid ""
"When comparing models, record the first-action delay shown in the terminal and the number of "
"successes out of scored trials."
msgstr "Model 비교 시 terminal에 표시되는 첫 action 지연과 평가한 trial 중 성공 수를 기록하세요."

msgid ""
"**Compare** with the original co-trained policy under the same starting conditions. Does the vial"
" still miss the slot? Check that any improvement in placement also preserves grasping, lifting, "
"and the return motion. Record your successes and failures, and compare them with the workshop "
"results above."
msgstr ""
"같은 시작 조건에서 원래 Co-Trained policy와 **비교**하세요. Vial이 여전히 slot을 놓치나요? Placement 개선과 함께 grasp, lift, "
"복귀도 유지되는지 확인합니다. 성공과 실패를 기록하고 위 workshop 결과와 비교하세요."

msgid "Key Takeaways"
msgstr "핵심 내용"

msgid "Collect corrections where the policy needs help."
msgstr "Policy에 도움이 필요한 곳에서 correction을 수집합니다."

msgid "Mix corrections with compatible demonstrations before fine-tuning."
msgstr "Fine-tuning 전에 correction과 호환되는 demonstration을 혼합합니다."

msgid "Test the updated policy without human assistance."
msgstr "갱신된 policy는 사람의 도움 없이 시험합니다."

msgid "Resources"
msgstr "참고 자료"

msgid ""
"[HG-DAgger: Interactive Imitation Learning with Human Experts](https://arxiv.org/abs/1810.02890) "
"— the original method. This workshop prototype demonstrates manual takeovers, however the paper "
"also explores an uncertainty-based risk measure for deciding when the expert should take over."
msgstr ""
"[HG-DAgger: Interactive Imitation Learning with Human Experts](https://arxiv.org/abs/1810.02890) "
"— 원래 방법을 소개한 paper입니다. 이 workshop prototype은 수동 개입을 보여주며, paper에서는 expert 개입 시점을 정하는 uncertainty "
"기반 risk measure도 다룹니다."

msgid ""
"[Reviewing collected demonstrations](08-simulation-teleoperation.md#review-and-upload-collected-"
"data)"
msgstr "[수집 Demonstration 검토](08-simulation-teleoperation.md#review-and-upload-collected-data)"

